---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Online Model Cost"
  description="Online Model Cost is a browser LLM cost calculator for one-call and monthly AI model cost comparison across Claude, GPT, Gemini, and Grok."
>
  <main id="main" class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>What this site is.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Model Cost is a small set of calculators for LLM API spend. You paste or
        type counts here; the math runs in this browser. The prompt is not sent
        to a server.
      </p>
      <p>There are two tools:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          The <a href="/token-calculator">token calculator</a> counts characters
          and words, then prices one paste across Claude, GPT, Gemini, and Grok.
          GPT token counts use tiktoken in this tab. The other families are
          labeled estimates.
        </li>
        <li>
          The <a href="/api-cost-calculator">API cost calculator</a> takes tokens
          per request, requests per day, and users, and scales that to a monthly
          bill.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Catalog input and output rates live on the <a href="/rates">rates</a>
        page. They come from the OpenRouter public list. They are not an
        invoice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
